        "text": "A metered dose valve (MDV) is a precision aerosol valve that delivers a fixed, reproducible quantity of product with each actuation. It achieves this through an internal metering chamber — a small cavity of defined volume that fills with formulation between actuations and empties completely upon each press. MDVs are essential in pharmaceutical inhalers, topical drug sprays, and any application where dose precision directly affects safety or efficacy."
