              <tr>
                <td style="padding: 9px 14px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);">EPDM</td>
                <td style="padding: 9px 14px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);">HFA-propelled pharmaceutical MDIs; water-based aerosols</td>
                <td style="padding: 9px 14px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);">Excellent HFA compatibility; low extractables when properly compounded; good compression set resistance</td>
                <td style="padding: 9px 14px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);">Poor resistance to hydrocarbon solvents and LPG propellants</td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="background: #f4f4f2;">
                <td style="padding: 9px 14px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);">Buna-N (Nitrile / NBR)</td>
                <td style="padding: 9px 14px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);">LPG-propelled consumer aerosols; solvent-based products</td>
                <td style="padding: 9px 14px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);">Good hydrocarbon resistance; cost-effective; wide availability of compound grades</td>
