              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td style="padding: 9px 14px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);">Neoprene (Polychloroprene)</td>
                <td style="padding: 9px 14px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);">General industrial aerosols; products containing DME</td>
                <td style="padding: 9px 14px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);">Moderate solvent resistance; good mechanical durability; stable dimensional properties</td>
                <td style="padding: 9px 14px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);">Inferior to EPDM for HFA; some grades extract chlorinated compounds into formulation</td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="background: #f4f4f2;">
                <td style="padding: 9px 14px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);">Thermoplastic Elastomers (TPE/TPV)</td>
                <td style="padding: 9px 14px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);">Speciality pharmaceutical and personal care aerosols</td>
                <td style="padding: 9px 14px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);">Can be engineered for very low extractables; no cure system compounds; precise dimensional control</td>
                <td style="padding: 9px 14px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);">Higher material cost; compression set performance at elevated temperature must be carefully validated</td>
